{"id": "EUVD-2026-108792", "enisaUuid": "a1847d66-b132-36e7-b350-aa0f74c2c735", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/bridge: th1520-dw-hdmi: Fix remove() callback\n\nThis driver stores struct th1520_hdmi * in platform drvdata, but\nth1520_dw_hdmi_remove() was reading it back as struct dw_hdmi *\nand passing it to dw_hdmi_remove(), so teardown runs on the wrong\npointer.\n\nRetrieve struct th1520_hdmi * from platform drvdata and pass\nhdmi->dw_hdmi to dw_hdmi_remove().", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T12:20:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T12:20:18", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d7cd43c2f546170ed42b2498d13805f4f89193c1", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/01c83795d50ccdb441f60e89ff50767cb2f6045a"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98998"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "08b143e0-e764-3d7d-bb0d-589e4438fb3a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.11"}, {"id": "10670df3-dd21-36e2-a533-56b126dcec8b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "96f30ee0fb9db1663eb8fd55c12e4c67da8c4a90 <d7cd43c2f546170ed42b2498d13805f4f89193c1"}, {"id": "2412516c-38ed-379b-840e-03ea5f5ad4ee", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.1"}, {"id": "8a855195-f4d9-3499-a593-99f0fc645eda", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "da0423b3-af62-3827-9795-b5a82c14eca5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "dcb363a6-3f26-3552-ac6e-97f36ca4a570", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "96f30ee0fb9db1663eb8fd55c12e4c67da8c4a90 <01c83795d50ccdb441f60e89ff50767cb2f6045a"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f1ee5dcb-0503-3d25-82a0-35b187368fc4", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}